---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { META } from '../data/meta';
---
<Layout route="about" title={META['about'].title} description={META['about'].description}>
<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 tabindex="-1">About Pasticceria Dolce Vita</h1>
    <svg class="swoosh" viewBox="0 0 148 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 10C34 3 66 2 92 6s38 6 54-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    <p class="lede">An Italian cake shop in Carnes Hill Marketplace, South West Sydney.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="band on-white">
  <div class="wrap about-grid about-grid--top">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <h2>A taste of Italian tradition, 40 years in the making</h2>
      <svg class="swoosh" viewBox="0 0 148 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 10C34 3 66 2 92 6s38 6 54-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      <p class="lede">Welcome to Pasticceria Dolce Vita, a family-owned Italian cake shop at Carnes Hill Marketplace in South West Sydney. We specialise in traditional continental cakes, gelato cakes, cannoli and Italian pastries, made with the same care and recipes that families have trusted for decades.</p>
      <h3>Our story</h3>
      <p>Pasticceria Dolce Vita is led by Domenic Marchetta, who has spent more than 40 years making Italian cakes. In the 1990s he opened his first shop, Boulevarde Cakes, on The Boulevarde in Fairfield, and it quickly became a local favourite. Now, with Dolce Vita, Domenic is back doing what he loves most, in a shop of his own.</p>
      <p>Over the years, generations of Sydney families have come back to Domenic for their birthdays, anniversaries and milestone celebrations. We&rsquo;ve even had guests at 21st birthday parties tell us he&rsquo;s made every birthday cake they&rsquo;ve ever had. That kind of trust is what makes this work so rewarding.</p>
      <h3>Made the traditional way</h3>
      <p>A great cake starts with quality ingredients, time-honoured techniques and a real love for the craft. Our continental cakes are made with light sponge and traditional custard and ricotta fillings, and our cannoli are filled fresh in crisp, crunchy shells for that authentic Italian taste.</p>
      <figure class="promise">
        <blockquote><p>Whenever you come to us, you can expect the finest ingredients and the highest-quality cakes. That&rsquo;s our promise, and our guarantee.</p></blockquote>
        <figcaption>Pasticceria Dolce Vita</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <h3>Cakes for every celebration</h3>
      <p>We make custom cakes to order for birthdays, engagements, christenings, family gatherings and seasonal occasions like Father&rsquo;s Day and Christmas. Our cabinet is also stocked daily with individual cakes, Italian pastries, pies and sausage rolls, perfect for a little everyday treat.</p>
      <p>We&rsquo;re proud to serve Carnes Hill and the surrounding South West Sydney suburbs, including Hoxton Park, Horningsea Park, West Hoxton, Edmondson Park and Liverpool.</p>
      <h3>Visit or order online</h3>
      <p>Browse our cake range and <a href="/order">order online</a> for easy in-store pickup, or visit us at Carnes Hill Marketplace to talk through your custom cake ideas with our team.</p>
      <p>Whatever the occasion, we&rsquo;d love to be part of it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-photos">
      <figure class="about-photo">
        <img src="/images/storefront.jpg" alt="The Dolce Vita shopfront at Carnes Hill Marketplace, with glass cabinets full of cakes and pastries" width="739" height="415" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <div class="duo">
        <img src="/images/cakes.jpg" alt="Three cakes topped with cream, biscuits, chocolate and strawberries, each with a Dolce Vita label" width="399" height="501" loading="lazy">
        <img src="/images/cabinet.jpg" alt="The cake cabinet filled with cannoli, pastries and whole cakes" width="450" height="450" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="cta on-mist">
  <div class="wrap cta-row">
    <div>
      <h2>Planning a celebration?</h2>
      <p>Order a cake from our range online for pickup. For custom cakes, call us or come in store.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-black" href="/order">Order a cake</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="tel:+61478774466">Call 0478 774 466</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
